      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/15746",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Educational programs, tours, and events run by the Highland Township Historical Society teach residents about the region’s past.",
